  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Illicit Finance Network (ODA eligible projects)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project houses the IF resilience fund, to enable the IF network at Post to initiate small-scale, catalytic projects, and is proposed to scale from FY24/25 to FY28/29. This presents a small investment per IF lead and will include in-country and regional projects. All projects will be ODA eligible.</narrative>
  </description>
